{"name":"Enchanted Developers Only","dev":"Augustinas Malinauskas","keys":["ios:6474268307"],"ios":{"id":"6474268307","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/enchanted-developers-only/id6474268307?uo=4","rating":4.30952,"ratings":84,"price":"Free","genre":"Developer Tools","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/c2/3a/23/c23a234f-a1d8-fb22-2d70-309c96cf1f5c/17f5b114-cef5-4584-befa-e48acd1ff3ad_111.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/44/75/96/447596a3-70e8-a360-6f94-a193ed99c0b2/1f0638bd-29cd-4ba4-8ea0-346716461d31_fuckthatshit.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/90/0a/b4/900ab4b2-13fb-3cad-de8d-7b3aee61230f/d6cb617e-8971-41cf-8d93-694f1ca94452_save.png/392x696bb.png"],"desc":"Enchanted is chat app for LLM researchers to chat with self hosted models. Enchanted supports Ollama API and all ecosystem models. It is necessary to have a running Ollama server to use this app and specify the server endpoint in app settings. Enchanted supports streaming and latest Chat API with conversation context. You can quickly switch between your models to test your prompts. Enchanted supports Markdown, therefore tables, lists and code will be nicely formatted. The app is in early days, but had a long roadmap to be leading tool for LLM community running self hosted models.","released":"2023-12-15","updated":"2025-08-19","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/a2/50/4d/a2504d41-3095-85b6-4db0-9ae7ef0b8eaa/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/a2/50/4d/a2504d41-3095-85b6-4db0-9ae7ef0b8eaa/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Developer Tools","rating":4.31,"ratings":84,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":1,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":1,"self_n":0,"hn_score":3.0,"first":1733454432,"last":1733454432,"show_hn":null,"n